var e={topic:`faith-spiritual-life`,lang:`ht`,strings:[{t:`Charlotte Christian rele tèt li “yon lekòl ki santre sou Kris la, ki prepare elèv pou inivèsite”. Li endepandan epi li pa tache ak okenn denominasyon. Chak elèv pran yon kou Bib chak ane, depi Junior Kindergarten rive nan 12yèm ane. Chak divizyon gen yon chapèl chak semèn.`,of:`e78f96fc`,at:[`charlotte-christian:lead.strong`]},{t:`“Lekòl la pa anba direksyon, enfliyans ni sipò okenn legliz an patikilye”, se sa li di.`,of:`3b304585`,at:[`charlotte-christian:lead.muted`]},{t:`Chak semèn`,of:`417cc4ce`,at:[`charlotte-christian:stats[0].value`]},{t:`chapèl nan chak divizyon`,of:`bd8a9141`,at:[`charlotte-christian:stats[0].label`]},{t:`Lower School chak jedi, Middle School chak madi ak Upper School chak mèkredi, dapre kalandriye 2026–27 la`,of:`fe7bc3fd`,at:[`charlotte-christian:stats[0].note`]},{t:`kredi Etid Biblik pou gradye`,of:`0c43c16a`,at:[`charlotte-christian:stats[1].label`]},{t:`yon kou Bib pou chak ane yon elèv enskri nan Upper School`,of:`fbf979d1`,at:[`charlotte-christian:stats[1].note`]},{t:`legliz kretyen, ak plis`,of:`1033fce9`,at:[`charlotte-christian:stats[2].label`]},{t:`“fanmi nou yo se manm plis pase 130 legliz kretyen diferan”`,of:`71766cd1`,at:[`charlotte-christian:stats[2].note`]},{t:`èdtan sèvis, Klas 2026`,of:`dd23d2b8`,at:[`charlotte-christian:stats[3].label`]},{t:`klas la te fè pandan ane li yo nan Upper School`,of:`d858a35b`,at:[`charlotte-christian:stats[3].note`]},{t:`Chak divizyon gen pwòp chapèl pa li chak semèn nan oditoryòm lekòl la, epi tout lekòl la reyini pou kat lòt chak ane. Paran yo resevwa yon rezime chapèl chak semèn yo pa imel.`,of:`b6b4524b`,at:[`charlotte-christian:chapel.headline`]},{t:`Chapèl Lower School`,of:`00c05305`,at:[`charlotte-christian:chapel.entries[0].title`]},{t:`Chak jedi, 8:15–8:45 AM, Alkire Auditorium. “Chapèl chak semèn, direktè lavi espirityèl la dirije yo.”`,of:`9578beba`,at:[`charlotte-christian:chapel.entries[0].text`]},{t:`Pami oratè ki sou lis otòn 2026 la gen konseye Lower School la ak direktè Lower School la. Yon semèn, pwofesè ak elèv te jwe yon istwa ki soti nan liv Dànyèl la.`,of:`ce1d7c82`,at:[`charlotte-christian:chapel.entries[0].muted`]},{t:`Chapèl Middle School`,of:`16378e57`,at:[`charlotte-christian:chapel.entries[1].title`]},{t:`Chak madi, 9:30–10:05 AM, Alkire Auditorium. Chapèl yo fèt an seri ki gen non tankou “Blessing Burglars” (Vòlè benediksyon).`,of:`a497ab45`,at:[`charlotte-christian:chapel.entries[1].text`]},{t:`Pami oratè ki sou lis 2026 la gen Pastè Kanpis la, Direktè Lavi Espirityèl Middle School la, pwofesè Middle School ak yon elèv lidè Upper School. Gen dirijan adorasyon envite ki vin vizite.`,of:`d9ed8570`,at:[`charlotte-christian:chapel.entries[1].muted`]},{t:`Chapèl Upper School`,of:`c9d9a258`,at:[`charlotte-christian:chapel.entries[2].title`]},{t:`Chak mèkredi, 9:25–10:05 AM, Alkire Auditorium.`,of:`37fdadb0`,at:[`charlotte-christian:chapel.entries[2].text`]},{t:`Pami dènye chapèl yo gen yon diskou direktè Upper School la ak “yon panèl fanmi Charlotte Christian” sou “sa sa vle di onore Bondye antanke fanmi”.`,of:`798e1179`,at:[`charlotte-christian:chapel.entries[2].muted`]},{t:`Chapèl pou tout lekòl la`,of:`e2630cbf`,at:[`charlotte-christian:chapel.entries[3].title`,`hickory-grove-christian:chapel.entries[2].title`]},{t:`Kat sou kalandriye 2026–27 la: Rantre lekòl, Thanksgiving (Jou Aksyon de Gras), Pak ak Jounen Nasyonal Lapriyè, ki fèt deyò sou teren lekòl la ak nan estad li a.`,of:`fc758c66`,at:[`charlotte-christian:chapel.entries[3].text`]},{t:`Elèv dènye ane yo gen tou yon Baccalaureate Service (sèvis relijye pou gradye yo) nan mwa me.`,of:`ea028f36`,at:[`charlotte-christian:chapel.entries[3].muted`]},{t:`KnightLight Worship`,of:`38ca8c7e`,at:[`charlotte-christian:chapel.entries[4].title`]},{t:`Ekip adorasyon Lower School la. “Elèv klas 3 ak 4 gen dwa pase odisyon”. Ekip la fè repetisyon chak mèkredi apre lekòl epi li dirije “adorasyon pou chapèl Lower School la plizyè fwa semès sa a”.`,of:`800f648f`,at:[`charlotte-christian:chapel.entries[4].text`]},{t:`uKnight Worship`,of:`a9fb8cb7`,at:[`charlotte-christian:chapel.entries[5].title`]},{t:`Yon ekip adorasyon elèv ki gen “chantè, mizisyen ak elèv teknisyen nan klas 9-12 ki dirije adorasyon nan chapèl yo pandan tout ane a”. Se yon kou honors sou odisyon, ki vo .5 kredi, epi li ka konte pou egzijans bozar la.`,of:`164eb926`,at:[`charlotte-christian:chapel.entries[5].text`]},{t:`Paran yo konnen sa yo te anseye.`,of:`30cb3d72`,at:[`charlotte-christian:chapel.note.strong`]},{t:`Twa Direktè Lavi Espirityèl yo voye yon imel Chapel Recap (rezime chapèl) chak semèn, ak yon playlist ki gen “chante nou te chante nan chapèl semèn sa a”.`,of:`e6d128ad`,at:[`charlotte-christian:chapel.note.text`]},{t:`Chak chapèl fini ak menm benediksyon an, ki soti nan Micah 6:8. Jou ak lè chapèl yo suiv kalandriye 2026–27 lekòl la. Gen semèn ki pa gen chapèl.`,of:`898d5f14`,at:[`charlotte-christian:chapel.note.muted`]},{t:`Bib se yon kou obligatwa chak ane, depi Junior Kindergarten rive nan 12yèm ane. Men sa chak klas etidye, ak kat kredi yon elèv Upper School bezwen pou gradye.`,of:`2ac4ec61`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.headline`]},{t:`“Etid Bib la se yon pati obligatwa nan pwogram lekòl la, ki kòmanse nan Junior Kindergarten epi ki kontinye jiska 12yèm ane.”`,of:`a011b44b`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.intro.text`]},{t:`“Se English Standard Version Bib la yo itilize nan tout klas yo.” Se fanmi yo ki achte Bib la; li sou lis founiti lekòl pou klas 1–12.`,of:`ca8c90ba`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.intro.muted`]},{t:`Lower School`,of:`0921a0ca`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.groups[0].name`]},{t:`leson Bib chak jou`,of:`733a59bd`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.groups[0].tally`]},{t:`Junior Kindergarten`,of:`5ee6535c`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.groups[0].rows[0].label`]},{t:`“Ewo lafwa yo, lanmou Bondye pou tout moun, verite Pawòl Bondye a”`,of:`b20811bb`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.groups[0].rows[0].detail`]},{t:`Kindergarten`,of:`68541d89`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.groups[0].rows[1].label`]},{t:`“Apèsi sou Bib la”`,of:`3ee57c76`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.groups[0].rows[1].detail`]},{t:`Klas 1`,of:`20673dd7`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.groups[0].rows[2].label`]},{t:`“Depi Kreyasyon an rive nan Tè Pwomiz la”`,of:`54566fbf`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.groups[0].rows[2].detail`]},{t:`Klas 2`,of:`21673f6a`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.groups[0].rows[3].label`]},{t:`“Levanjil yo”`,of:`105465d2`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.groups[0].rows[3].detail`]},{t:`Klas 3`,of:`226740fd`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.groups[0].rows[4].label`]},{t:`“Izrayèl”`,of:`53429d22`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.groups[0].rows[4].detail`]},{t:`Klas 4`,of:`1b6735f8`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.groups[0].rows[5].label`]},{t:`“Travay apot yo ak Legliz nan kòmansman an”. Elèv katriyèm ane yo “pran yon kou entwodiksyon nan apolojetik kretyen” tou (aprann eksplike ak defann lafwa a).`,of:`5497d699`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.groups[0].rows[5].detail`]},{t:`Middle School`,of:`15441234`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.groups[1].name`,`hickory-grove-christian:classes.groups[1].name`]},{t:`yon kou Bib chak ane, plis lekti Ekriti yo chak jou`,of:`4b6fc13e`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.groups[1].tally`]},{t:`Bible 5`,of:`672446e6`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.groups[1].rows[0].label`]},{t:`Pwofesi sou Kris la: “yon etid sou liv Jenèz la”`,of:`67866b7d`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.groups[1].rows[0].detail`]},{t:`Bible 6`,of:`66244553`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.groups[1].rows[1].label`]},{t:`Preparasyon pou Kris la: “yon etid sou Ansyen Testaman an, ki kòmanse ak Egzòd epi ki fini ak 400 Ane Silans yo”.`,of:`72467c36`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.groups[1].rows[1].detail`]},{t:`Bible 7`,of:`652443c0`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.groups[1].rows[2].label`]},{t:`Plan Kris la: “yon apèsi sou Nouvo Testaman an”.`,of:`6acb1671`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.groups[1].rows[2].detail`]},{t:`Bible 8`,of:`74245b5d`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.groups[1].rows[3].label`]},{t:`Pèsòn Kris la: lavi ak ansèyman Jezi “jan Levanjil Jan an prezante yo yon fason inik”.`,of:`29554636`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.groups[1].rows[3].detail`]},{t:`Upper School`,of:`bfabeb69`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.groups[2].name`]},{t:`4 kredi Etid Biblik pou gradye`,of:`c9c95bce`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.groups[2].tally`]},{t:`Old Testament Survey`,of:`6b2cd411`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.groups[2].rows[0].label`,`hickory-grove-christian:classes.groups[2].rows[0].label`]},{t:`Egzijans pou premye ane.`,of:`389bafe0`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.groups[2].rows[0].detail`]},{t:`New Testament Survey`,of:`15a0fcf0`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.groups[2].rows[1].label`,`hickory-grove-christian:classes.groups[2].rows[1].label`]},{t:`Egzijans pou dezyèm ane.`,of:`b9ac76f8`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.groups[2].rows[1].detail`]},{t:`Christian Theology`,of:`3a8071fd`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.groups[2].rows[2].label`]},{t:`Egzijans pou twazyèm ane. “Elèv yo ap aprann istwa legliz la depi epòk Nouvo Testaman an rive nan Refòm nan.”`,of:`5056d764`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.groups[2].rows[2].detail`]},{t:`World Religions`,of:`a0cf6333`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.groups[2].rows[3].label`]},{t:`Egzijans pou twazyèm ane. Kou a se “yon egzamen kritik sou ansyen relijyon yo, relijyon Oryan yo (ki gen ladan Endouyis ak Boudis), Jidayis ak Islam”.`,of:`ff42b6fe`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.groups[2].rows[3].detail`]},{t:`Apologetics and Cultural Engagement`,of:`6b124f9d`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.groups[2].rows[4].label`]},{t:`Egzijans pou dènye ane. Premye semès la kouvri apolojetik. Dezyèm nan kouvri “fondman biblik ak teyolojik pou angajman nan kilti a”.`,of:`05c1557f`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.groups[2].rows[4].detail`]},{t:`Yon elèv ki antre ta pran Bib kanmenm.`,of:`567deb60`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.note.strong`]},{t:`“Elèv yo dwe konplete yon kou Bib chak ane yo enskri nan Charlotte Christian School. Si yo admèt yon elèv nan dènye ane, l ap oblije konplete kou Bib twazyèm ane a ak kou Bib dènye ane a, tou de.”`,of:`91bce979`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.note.text`]},{t:`Elèv yo ka gradye tou ak distenksyon nan Bible, Philosophy & Religion (Bib, filozofi ak relijyon). Pami egzijans li yo gen yon GPA 3.89 nan Bib, patisipasyon aktif nan yon legliz lokal ak yon entèvyou ak depatman Bib la.`,of:`2ce95422`,at:[`charlotte-christian:classes.note.muted`]},{t:`Chak divizyon gen yon aktivite nan otòn ki rezève pou lafwa ak zanmitay. Klas 5–12 yo ale nan mòn North Carolina yo, epi pri a fè pati frè eskolè a.`,of:`beed9505`,at:[`charlotte-christian:retreats.headline`]},{t:`Lower School: Camp S.L.A.M.`,of:`99a07ae0`,at:[`charlotte-christian:retreats.cells[0].title`]},{t:`“Tout elèv Lower School ap patisipe nan yon jounen konplè aktivite Camp S.L.A.M. (Spiritual Life and Meaning)” (lavi espirityèl ak sans). Jounen an gen jwèt an ekip, “louwanj, adorasyon ak etid”. Oratè otòn 2026 la se te Direktè Lavi Espirityèl Lower School la. Klas 4 gen pwòp jounen pa li pou lidèchip ak travay an ekip.`,of:`d5744e60`,at:[`charlotte-christian:retreats.cells[0].text`]},{t:`Middle School: Carolina Point`,of:`f2a7a675`,at:[`charlotte-christian:retreats.cells[1].title`]},{t:`“Kòm yon pati esansyèl nan eksperyans Middle School la, tout elèv patisipe nan retrèt Carolina Point chak ane a”, nan yon sant retrèt Young Life “andeyò Brevard, N.C.” Tèm otòn 2026 la se te “The Rejoice Choice” (Chwa pou rejwi). Chak sesyon gen jwèt, mizik adorasyon ak yon oratè, ak devosyon nan kabin yo aswè.`,of:`1f0cbfe9`,at:[`charlotte-christian:retreats.cells[1].text`]},{t:`Upper School: Windy Gap`,of:`fd6412c8`,at:[`charlotte-christian:retreats.cells[2].title`]},{t:`Lekòl la di “yo mande tout elèv patisipe nan retrèt Windy Gap chak ane a”, nan yon sant retrèt Young Life “andeyò Asheville, N.C.” Tèm otòn 2026 la se te “Transformed by Christ” (Transfòme pa Kris la). Apre chak nan kat sesyon adorasyon yo gen “Cabin Time, Reflection, and Sharing” (tan nan kabin, refleksyon ak pataj). Elèv dènye ane yo ale yon jou pi bonè.`,of:`0b4405fb`,at:[`charlotte-christian:retreats.cells[2].text`]},{t:`Enkli nan frè eskolè a:`,of:`adfa710e`,at:[`charlotte-christian:retreats.note.strong`]},{t:`“Retrèt Carolina Point ak Windy Gap (retrèt de jou sou lavi espirityèl pou Middle School ak Upper School) ak sòti eskolè yo.”`,of:`e5d1ff85`,at:[`charlotte-christian:retreats.note.text`]},{t:`“Retrèt sa yo posib sèlman grasa sipò paran volontè yo.”`,of:`ea0f66e6`,at:[`charlotte-christian:retreats.note.muted`]},{t:`Kote elèv yo pale sou lafwa nan pi piti gwoup: gwoup anvan lekòl, devosyon nan lè manje midi, gwoup advisory, ak elèv lidè.`,of:`49db66b0`,at:[`charlotte-christian:groups.headline`]},{t:`Gwoup DIG (Discipleship In Groups, fòmasyon disip an gwoup)`,of:`e8091e48`,at:[`charlotte-christian:groups.entries[0].title`]},{t:`Gwoup yo “reyini anvan lekòl chak mèkredi maten, soti 7:10-7:35 a.m.” pandan yon pati nan chak semès. “Se elèv volontè Upper School ki pral dirije gwoup sa yo, ak èd pwofesè Middle School.”`,of:`adce9425`,at:[`charlotte-christian:groups.entries[0].text`]},{t:`Manje midi ak devosyon`,of:`88ba61b5`,at:[`charlotte-christian:groups.entries[1].title`]},{t:`Direktè Lavi Espirityèl Middle School la dirije yon diskisyon chak semèn nan lè manje midi pou ti gason klas 8. Lòt gwoup yo gen ladan “Dodgeball & Devotions” (jwèt dodgeball ak devosyon) pou ti gason klas 5–7 ak yon gwoup devosyon pou tifi.`,of:`765d22c7`,at:[`charlotte-christian:groups.entries[1].text`]},{t:`Wayòm yo ak gwoup advisory`,of:`e9e85801`,at:[`charlotte-christian:groups.entries[2].title`]},{t:`“Six kingdoms, one king.” (Sis wayòm, yon sèl wa.) Chak elèv Middle School antre nan youn nan sis gwoup “ki reyini regilyèman pandan tout ane a”. Gwoup advisory yo fè etid biblik, epi elèv uityèm ane ka sèvi nan yon Kingdom Council (konsèy elèv) pou “lavi espirityèl ak lavi elèv”.`,of:`aaa1b13a`,at:[`charlotte-christian:groups.entries[2].text`]},{t:`Etid biblik Upper School`,of:`a456d99e`,at:[`charlotte-christian:groups.entries[3].title`]},{t:`Paran ak pwofesè ka dirije “yon etid biblik pou elèv Upper School” atravè Direktè Lavi Espirityèl Upper School la.`,of:`7bcf1ba1`,at:[`charlotte-christian:groups.entries[3].text`]},{t:`Paj lekòl la pa di ki lè gwoup sa yo reyini.`,of:`c5b18629`,at:[`charlotte-christian:groups.entries[3].muted`]},{t:`Elèv lidè`,of:`e60ca716`,at:[`charlotte-christian:groups.entries[4].title`]},{t:`Yon Spiritual Life Prefect (elèv lidè pou lavi espirityèl) se youn nan nèf elèv lidè dènye ane yo. Prefect yo pale epi yo priye nan chapèl, epi volontè Upper School dirije gwoup DIG Middle School yo.`,of:`bcb5af25`,at:[`charlotte-christian:groups.entries[4].text`]},{t:`Konferans sou lavi espirityèl`,of:`0a7d311a`,at:[`charlotte-christian:groups.entries[5].title`]},{t:`Nan jou konferans yo, “yo envite oratè espesyal sou kanpis la pou yon tan ansèyman ak diskisyon ki konsantre”.`,of:`265c7d69`,at:[`charlotte-christian:groups.entries[5].text`]},{t:`Misyon lekòl la, senk valè fondamantal li yo ak deklarasyon lafwa li an dis pwen, nan pwòp mo lekòl la.`,of:`ef08810f`,at:[`charlotte-christian:beliefs.headline`]},{t:`“Charlotte Christian School se yon lekòl ki santre sou Kris la, ki prepare elèv pou inivèsite, ki ekipe ak devlope elèv yo pou yo entegre verite biblik ak aprantisaj nan lavi yo chak jou yon fason efikas, epi pou yo gen enpak sou kilti a pou Kris la.”`,of:`aed901a1`,at:[`charlotte-christian:beliefs.mission`]},{t:`Renmen Bondye`,of:`aefdea87`,at:[`charlotte-christian:beliefs.values[0].name`]},{t:`Montre Bonte`,of:`6dca795d`,at:[`charlotte-christian:beliefs.values[1].name`]},{t:`Mache ak Imilite`,of:`0d4f9943`,at:[`charlotte-christian:beliefs.values[2].name`]},{t:`Pouswiv Ekselans`,of:`93d0e213`,at:[`charlotte-christian:beliefs.values[3].name`]},{t:`Chèche Verite`,of:`635804ac`,at:[`charlotte-christian:beliefs.values[4].name`]},{t:`Pa gen okenn legliz an patikilye ki dirije lekòl la.`,of:`4eed29f4`,at:[`charlotte-christian:beliefs.note.strong`]},{t:`“Manm konsèy administrasyon an, pwofesè yo ak elèv yo reprezante divès denominasyon ak pratik. Lekòl la pa anba direksyon, enfliyans ni sipò okenn legliz an patikilye.”`,of:`62ae84e0`,at:[`charlotte-christian:beliefs.note.text`]},{t:`Vèsè tèm 2026–27 la se Philippians 4:4-7.`,of:`2f879cf3`,at:[`charlotte-christian:beliefs.note.muted`]},{t:`“Nou kwè Bondye se yon sèl èt – ki jis, saj, bon, plen lanmou e sen san limit, epi ki egziste pou tout tan nan twa pèsòn: Papa a, Pitit la ak Sentespri a. Se Li ki Kreyatè souvren linivè a, epi pa pwovidans Li, Li soutni e Li gouvènen tout sa Li fè.”`,of:`353df0da`,at:[`charlotte-christian:beliefs.articles[0]`]},{t:`“Nou kwè Jezikri, Pitit Bondye a, se Bondye nèt e se moun nèt, e Li sove pèp Li a anba peche yo pa lavi Li, lanmò Li ak rezirèksyon Li, epi kounye a L ap gouvènen Legliz Li a ak lemonn pa Pawòl Li ak Lespri Li.”`,of:`6b2bb59b`,at:[`charlotte-christian:beliefs.articles[1]`]},{t:`“Nou kwè Sentespri a fè pechè yo fèt yon lòt fwa, Li rete nan kwayan yo, e Li ba yo kapasite pou yo viv yon lavi ki fè Bondye plezi epi pou yo sèvi ak don espirityèl Li ba yo.”`,of:`98e462e3`,at:[`charlotte-christian:beliefs.articles[2]`]},{t:`“Nou kwè Ekriti Ansyen Testaman ak Nouvo Testaman yo se Pawòl Bondye, ki enspire, ki enfayib e ki san erè; se yo ki otorite final nou nan zafè doktrin ak pratik.”`,of:`bf248a55`,at:[`charlotte-christian:beliefs.articles[3]`]},{t:`“Nou kwè pechè yo jistifye pa lagras, grasa lafwa, sou baz travay Kris la fin akonpli a (lanmò Li ak rezirèksyon Li), e yo viv lavi sa a pa pisans Bondye.”`,of:`78d0acc5`,at:[`charlotte-christian:beliefs.articles[4]`]},{t:`“Nou kwè Bondye ap rele moun nan tout limanite pou yo kwè nan Pitit Li a, Jezikri, epi pou yo vin manm Kò Li a, Legliz la. Moun ki kwè nan Jezi kòm Senyè ak Sovè jwi benediksyon Bondye ak kominyon youn ak lòt nan kominote lafwa, jiskaske Jezi tounen.”`,of:`6246805c`,at:[`charlotte-christian:beliefs.articles[5]`]},{t:`“Nou kwè lòm, gason ak fi, te fèt dapre imaj Bondye, men li te tonbe nan peche akòz dezobeyisans Adan ak Èv. Kòm rezilta chit la, tout moun fèt pechè e yo bezwen delivrans.”`,of:`d8bf7734`,at:[`charlotte-christian:beliefs.articles[6]`]},{t:`“Nou kwè maryaj se yon relasyon alyans Bondye kreye pou yon gason ak yon fi. Entimite seksyèl se yon kado Bondye bay, e bon plas li se sèlman nan kad maryaj.”`,of:`e1e3a547`,at:[`charlotte-christian:beliefs.articles[7]`]},{t:`“Nou kwè Jezikri, Pitit Bondye a, ap tounen pou L renouvle tout kreyasyon an epi pou L jije moun ki vivan ak moun ki mouri.”`,of:`fe82762c`,at:[`charlotte-christian:beliefs.articles[8]`]},{t:`“Nou kwè edikasyon kretyen se yon patenarya ant elèv, pwofesè ak paran, ki bay elèv yo okazyon pou yo aprann epi viv etid akademik ak aktivite ko-kourikilè atravè yon vizyon biblik sou lemonn, nan prezans pwofesè ki onore Kris la.”`,of:`2ed3e072`,at:[`charlotte-christian:beliefs.articles[9]`]},{t:`Sa paj piblik lekòl la di sou lafwa lè w ap aplike ak lè ou fin enskri, ak sa yo pa di.`,of:`2700b011`,at:[`charlotte-christian:families.headline`,`hickory-grove-christian:families.headline`]},{t:`Lè w ap aplike`,of:`fbc4b036`,at:[`charlotte-christian:families.groups[0].name`,`hickory-grove-christian:families.groups[0].name`]},{t:`Kesyon sou lafwa elèv la`,of:`e7858d01`,at:[`charlotte-christian:families.groups[0].rows[0].label`]},{t:`Kandida pou klas 5–12 ranpli yon kesyonè alamen. Li poze kesyon sou “aktivite espirityèl ak/oswa aktivite ki gen rapò ak legliz” epi li di: “Dekri relasyon ou ak Jezikri.”`,of:`13953c35`,at:[`charlotte-christian:families.groups[0].rows[0].detail`]},{t:`Entèvyou ak fanmi an`,of:`94e34996`,at:[`charlotte-christian:families.groups[0].rows[1].label`,`hickory-grove-christian:families.groups[0].rows[1].label`]},{t:`Chak fanmi rankontre “yon manm ekip direksyon nou an” pou “pataje objektif pou pwochen etap nan pakou edikatif elèv ou a”.`,of:`47169ee7`,at:[`charlotte-christian:families.groups[0].rows[1].detail`]},{t:`Lafwa paran an menm`,of:`df592ad8`,at:[`charlotte-christian:families.groups[0].rows[2].label`,`hickory-grove-christian:families.groups[0].rows[4].label`]},{t:`Paj piblik yo pa di si yon paran dwe kretyen oswa si li dwe ale nan yon legliz.`,of:`592818ab`,at:[`charlotte-christian:families.groups[0].rows[2].detail`]},{t:`Referans yon pastè`,of:`cd83f059`,at:[`charlotte-christian:families.groups[0].rows[3].label`,`hickory-grove-christian:families.groups[0].rows[0].label`]},{t:`Pa gen okenn ki sou lis nan etap aplikasyon oswa lis verifikasyon ki pibliye yo.`,of:`34654847`,at:[`charlotte-christian:families.groups[0].rows[3].detail`]},{t:`Siyen deklarasyon lafwa a`,of:`d7d8e80b`,at:[`charlotte-christian:families.groups[0].rows[4].label`]},{t:`Li pa sou lis nan etap aplikasyon ki pibliye yo.`,of:`19d3e804`,at:[`charlotte-christian:families.groups[0].rows[4].detail`]},{t:`Lè ou fin enskri`,of:`d9033401`,at:[`charlotte-christian:families.groups[1].name`,`hickory-grove-christian:families.groups[1].name`]},{t:`Family Agreement Form`,of:`56281385`,at:[`charlotte-christian:families.groups[1].rows[0].label`]},{t:`“Ni paran ni elèv dwe li epi siyen nan fòma dijital Back-to-School Form sou entènèt la, ki gen ladan Family Agreement Form ak Responsible Use Policy, nan myCCS.” Fòm akò fanmi an menm pa sou sit piblik la.`,of:`9cdbb748`,at:[`charlotte-christian:families.groups[1].rows[0].detail`]},{t:`Kou Bib`,of:`6f74c399`,at:[`charlotte-christian:families.groups[1].rows[1].label`,`hickory-grove-christian:families.groups[1].rows[0].label`]},{t:`Obligatwa chak ane, depi Junior Kindergarten rive nan 12yèm ane.`,of:`a97a83b2`,at:[`charlotte-christian:families.groups[1].rows[1].detail`]},{t:`Retrèt`,of:`6e3383f9`,at:[`charlotte-christian:families.groups[1].rows[2].label`]},{t:`Nan Middle School, “tout elèv patisipe”. Nan Upper School, “yo mande tout elèv patisipe”.`,of:`914f06ef`,at:[`charlotte-christian:families.groups[1].rows[2].detail`]},{t:`Konduit elèv`,of:`e448eab0`,at:[`charlotte-christian:families.groups[1].rows[3].label`]},{t:`Kesyonè klas 5–12 la fini konsa: “Mwen konprann mwen dwe respekte règleman sa yo epi onore Kris la tout tan.” Honor Code (kòd onè) lekòl la aplike lajounen kou lannuit, pandan tout ane a.`,of:`270396a5`,at:[`charlotte-christian:families.groups[1].rows[3].detail`]},{t:`Patenarya ak paran yo`,of:`253a65fc`,at:[`charlotte-christian:families.groups[1].rows[4].label`]},{t:`Deklarasyon lafwa a rele edikasyon kretyen “yon patenarya ant elèv, pwofesè ak paran”.`,of:`42b2acae`,at:[`charlotte-christian:families.groups[1].rows[4].detail`]},{t:`Prezans nan chapèl`,of:`bf92e599`,at:[`charlotte-christian:families.groups[1].rows[5].label`,`hickory-grove-christian:families.groups[1].rows[3].label`]},{t:`Paj piblik yo pa di si chapèl obligatwa.`,of:`889f792d`,at:[`charlotte-christian:families.groups[1].rows[5].detail`,`hickory-grove-christian:families.groups[1].rows[3].detail`]},{t:`Pwofesè ak anplwaye yo dwe pataje lafwa a.`,of:`84aea924`,at:[`charlotte-christian:families.note.strong`,`hickory-grove-christian:families.note.strong`]},{t:`“Tout moun ki aplike pou travay dwe dispoze sèvi Kris la nan travay yo chak jou epi sipòte deklarasyon lafwa nou an nèt.”`,of:`b779f756`,at:[`charlotte-christian:families.note.text`]},{t:`Lekòl la kenbe Family Handbook (manyèl fanmi) li a, Honor Code li a ak aplikasyon sou entènèt li a dèyè yon koneksyon pou fanmi, pa sou sit piblik li a.`,of:`122d7c31`,at:[`charlotte-christian:families.note.muted`]},{t:`Lekòl la konsidere sèvis kòm yon pati nan lafwa. Elèv yo sèvi òganizasyon lokal san bi likratif pandan tout ane a, epi elèv Upper School ka patisipe nan vwayaj misyonè pandan Winterim.`,of:`e01e46c3`,at:[`charlotte-christian:service.headline`]},{t:`Jounen sèvis pou tout lekòl la`,of:`233e085e`,at:[`charlotte-christian:service.entries[0].title`]},{t:`Nan prentan 2026, lekòl la “te anbale 79,056 repa” ansanm ak Servants with a Heart.`,of:`06b1ea3b`,at:[`charlotte-christian:service.entries[0].text`]},{t:`Operation Christmas Child`,of:`c21f19dc`,at:[`charlotte-christian:service.entries[1].title`]},{t:`Objektif otòn 2026 la se te “ranpli 1,850 bwat soulye” alè pou chapèl Thanksgiving la. Lòt patnè yo nonmen se The Odd Sock, Bright Blessings, Roof Above ak Harvest Center.`,of:`83d1f787`,at:[`charlotte-christian:service.entries[1].text`]},{t:`Kingdom Impact Day`,of:`e47ad8fe`,at:[`charlotte-christian:service.entries[2].title`]},{t:`“Sis òganizasyon lokal san bi likratif te pale sou misyon yo” ak elèv Middle School nan prentan 2026. Yon kolèk kreyon koulè apa nan Middle School te ranmase “98,484 kreyon koulè”.`,of:`c375240b`,at:[`charlotte-christian:service.entries[2].text`]},{t:`Vwayaj misyonè Winterim`,of:`a2547bb4`,at:[`charlotte-christian:service.entries[3].title`]},{t:`“Upper School la ofri divès okazyon vwayaj misyonè lokal, rejyonal ak entènasyonal pandan tout ane a, enkli pandan Winterim.” Lis 2027 la gen ladan yon semèn Serve Charlotte ak vwayaj ak SCORE International, Rancho El Camino ak Samaritan’s Feet.`,of:`583ae11a`,at:[`charlotte-christian:service.entries[3].text`]},{t:`Èdtan sèvis kòmanse nan sizyèm ane.`,of:`e7835585`,at:[`charlotte-christian:service.note.strong`]},{t:`“Apati sizyèm ane, yo ankouraje elèv yo fè èdtan sèvis chak ane”.`,of:`b080f66b`,at:[`charlotte-christian:service.note.text`]},{t:`Paj lekòl la pa bay yon kantite èdtan pou chak klas.`,of:`47443ecb`,at:[`charlotte-christian:service.note.muted`]},{t:`Chak divizyon gen pwòp direktè lavi espirityèl pa li. Lekòl la mansyone tou yon pastè kanpis, yon kowòdonatè sèvis ak yon kowòdonatè adorasyon.`,of:`ce5f769a`,at:[`charlotte-christian:staff.headline`]},{t:`Direktè Lavi Espirityèl Lower School`,of:`164a935d`,at:[`charlotte-christian:staff.people[0].role`]},{t:`Direktè Lavi Espirityèl Middle School, Pwofesè Bib Middle School`,of:`6e6cbd6a`,at:[`charlotte-christian:staff.people[1].role`]},{t:`Direktè Lavi Espirityèl Upper School`,of:`0c132c42`,at:[`charlotte-christian:staff.people[2].role`]},{t:`Pastè Kanpis`,of:`a4b30e91`,at:[`charlotte-christian:staff.people[3].role`]},{t:`Pwofesè Difizyon ak Fim Upper School, Kowòdonatè Sèvis`,of:`c6474b3e`,at:[`charlotte-christian:staff.people[4].role`]},{t:`Kowòdonatè Bozar ak Adorasyon`,of:`d987057b`,at:[`charlotte-christian:staff.people[5].role`]},{t:`Pwofesè Bib Upper School, Chèf Depatman Bib`,of:`27b58135`,at:[`charlotte-christian:staff.people[6].role`]},{t:`Kòmanse ak direktè divizyon pitit ou a.`,of:`b6411b3b`,at:[`charlotte-christian:staff.note.strong`]},{t:`Gen senk lòt pwofesè Bib ki nan anyè lekòl la.`,of:`645d41b5`,at:[`charlotte-christian:staff.note.muted`]},{t:`Etid biblik, gwoup lapriyè ak imel chak semèn lekòl la òganize pou paran ak granparan.`,of:`af457c9d`,at:[`charlotte-christian:parents.headline`]},{t:`Imel pou fanmi yo`,of:`5601fdb3`,at:[`charlotte-christian:parents.entries[0].title`]},{t:`Yon Chapel Recap Direktè Lavi Espirityèl yo voye, ak yon nòt chak lendi direktè jeneral lekòl la voye “ak yon ti refleksyon devosyonèl ak kèk demann lapriyè pou tout lekòl la”.`,of:`188b61b8`,at:[`charlotte-christian:parents.entries[0].text`]},{t:`Etid biblik Haverim pou medam`,of:`aed144bd`,at:[`charlotte-christian:parents.entries[1].title`]},{t:`“Mèkredi soti 12:15-2:15 p.m. OSWA madi sou Zoom soti 7:30-8:30 p.m.” Li ouvri pou “manman, grann, manman ansyen elèv, ak anplwaye”. Etid 2026–27 la se sou liv Women an.`,of:`5a3d57c7`,at:[`charlotte-christian:parents.entries[1].text`]},{t:`Parents in Prayer`,of:`ca4f5668`,at:[`charlotte-christian:parents.entries[2].title`]},{t:`Chak jedi, 8:00–9:30 AM sou kanpis la, ak yon sesyon vityèl anviwon yon fwa pa mwa. “Paran k ap priye yo priye regilyèman pou ti gason oswa tifi ki nan nivo klas pitit yo”.`,of:`839ff8ec`,at:[`charlotte-christian:parents.entries[2].text`]},{t:`Men’s Power Hour`,of:`68cdfc78`,at:[`charlotte-christian:parents.entries[3].title`]},{t:`“Pou mesye CCS yo”, yon reyinyon chak mwa nan maten andeyò kanpis la.`,of:`1a6be535`,at:[`charlotte-christian:parents.entries[3].text`]},{t:`Books and Fellowship`,of:`0bed32bd`,at:[`charlotte-christian:parents.entries[4].title`]},{t:`“Pou medam CCS yo”, chak mwa soti 8-9:15 a.m. nan yon kay prive.`,of:`65856cef`,at:[`charlotte-christian:parents.entries[4].text`]},{t:`Romans 12 Gatherings`,of:`a94dd44c`,at:[`charlotte-christian:parents.entries[5].title`]},{t:`Ouvri pou tout kominote lekòl la, pou pale sou “divèsite, apatenans, ak kòmandman Jezi pou nou viv nan inite ak rekonsilyasyon youn ak lòt”.`,of:`28908133`,at:[`charlotte-christian:parents.entries[5].text`]},{t:`Knight to Knight`,of:`7ef8970a`,at:[`charlotte-christian:parents.entries[6].title`]},{t:`Yo mete fanmi elèv Lower School ak Middle School ansanm ak elèv dènye ane yo pou “ankouraje yo, priye pou yo epi beni yo” nan dènye ane yo.`,of:`32740259`,at:[`charlotte-christian:parents.entries[6].text`]},{t:`Chak paran fè pati Parent Teacher Fellowship (asosyasyon paran ak pwofesè).`,of:`1eb6ea9d`,at:[`charlotte-christian:parents.note.strong`]},{t:`Youn nan travay li se “sipò lapriyè ki esansyèl pou tout aspè kominote lekòl la”.`,of:`dfbbcd1a`,at:[`charlotte-christian:parents.note.text`]},{t:`Dis kesyon pou w pote nan vizit la. Chak kesyon se sou yon bagay paj piblik lekòl la pa reponn oswa di de fason diferan.`,of:`d45f86d9`,at:[`charlotte-christian:ask.headline`]},{t:`Èske yon paran dwe kretyen, oswa manm yon legliz, pou yo admèt yon timoun?`,of:`a0e1e94d`,at:[`charlotte-christian:ask.questions[0]`,`hickory-grove-christian:ask.questions[0]`]},{t:`Kisa Family Agreement Form (fòm akò fanmi) mande paran ak elèv dakò ak li? Èske nou ka li l anvan nou aplike?`,of:`f2ef1a03`,at:[`charlotte-christian:ask.questions[1]`]},{t:`Kisa lekòl la ap chèche nan repons yon elèv bay pou “Dekri relasyon ou ak Jezikri”?`,of:`e6939ed5`,at:[`charlotte-christian:ask.questions[2]`]},{t:`Èske chapèl obligatwa pou chak elèv?`,of:`7ff625fb`,at:[`charlotte-christian:ask.questions[3]`,`hickory-grove-christian:ask.questions[3]`]},{t:`Konbyen èdtan sèvis chak klas bezwen? Yon paj di yo “ankouraje” èdtan yo, yon lòt pale de “èdtan sèvis lekòl la egzije”.`,of:`ac2ba319`,at:[`charlotte-christian:ask.questions[4]`]},{t:`Ki lè etid biblik Upper School yo reyini, kiyès ki dirije yo, epi kijan yon elèv ka antre nan youn?`,of:`1d7fb7f2`,at:[`charlotte-christian:ask.questions[5]`]},{t:`Ki pwogram Bib Lower School ak Middle School itilize? Èske elèv yo aprann vèsè Ekriti pa kè?`,of:`5c351240`,at:[`charlotte-christian:ask.questions[6]`]},{t:`Kisa Pastè Kanpis la fè, epi èske fanmi yo ka rankontre l?`,of:`6a615ab5`,at:[`charlotte-christian:ask.questions[7]`]},{t:`Kijan yon elèv ki fèk vin nan lafwa kretyen an, oswa ki soti nan yon lòt relijyon, jwenn plas li isit la?`,of:`95f84c62`,at:[`charlotte-christian:ask.questions[8]`]},{t:`Èske nou ka li Honor Code ak Family Handbook anvan nou enskri?`,of:`9858f9f0`,at:[`charlotte-christian:ask.questions[9]`]},{t:`26 novanm 2026`,of:`2ffc88e3`,at:[`charlotte-christian:ask.asOf`,`hickory-grove-christian:ask.asOf`]},{t:`Hickory Grove Christian School se “yon ministè Hickory Grove Baptist Church”. Legliz la te kòmanse l nan 1995. Elèv yo pran Bib kòm yon kou prensipal chak ane, epi pastè legliz la anseye nan chapèl.`,of:`4b2d51ae`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:lead.strong`]},{t:`Lekòl la di: “Lafwa kretyen se baz tout sa nou fè nan Hickory Grove Christian School.”`,of:`9c24d508`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:lead.muted`]},{t:`chapèl chak ane`,of:`ae6fed75`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:stats[0].label`]},{t:`uit maten kote chapèl la fèt an de pati, ak de chapèl pou tout lekòl la, sou kalandriye 2026–27 la`,of:`1d154f58`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:stats[0].note`]},{t:`ane Bib kòm kou prensipal`,of:`4e53c4e2`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:stats[1].label`]},{t:`“depi kindergarten rive nan 12yèm ane”`,of:`d492bfb3`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:stats[1].note`]},{t:`kredi Bib pou gradye`,of:`0462af41`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:stats[2].label`]},{t:`yon kou Bib pou chak ane nan High School, sou 27 kredi an tout`,of:`eb9a213b`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:stats[2].note`]},{t:`vèsè Bib aprann pa kè`,of:`977db8d7`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:stats[3].label`]},{t:`rive nan fen Elementary School, anviwon youn chak semèn`,of:`a9d6d4a3`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:stats[3].note`]},{t:`Chapèl reyini dis fwa pa ane, sitou jedi maten. Elèv Elementary School yo adore an premye, apre sa se tou Middle School ak High School. Pastè Hickory Grove Baptist Church anseye, epi elèv yo ede dirije mizik la.`,of:`aeef5967`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:chapel.headline`]},{t:`Chapèl Elementary School`,of:`ae9892da`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:chapel.entries[0].title`]},{t:`A 8:00 AM nan maten chapèl yo. Seri 2026–27 la “swiv gason ak fanm nan Bib la ki te kanpe fèm pou Bondye”.`,of:`cdc1a198`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:chapel.entries[0].text`]},{t:`Pami oratè otòn 2026 yo te gen Family Discipleship Pastors (pastè fòmasyon disip pou fanmi) legliz la.`,of:`f070b25c`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:chapel.entries[0].muted`]},{t:`Chapèl Middle School ak High School`,of:`21c42430`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:chapel.entries[1].title`]},{t:`A 9:30 AM, nan sanktyè legliz la. Tèm 2026–27 la se “Here I Stand” (Men kote m kanpe). Elèv Middle School yo pran nòt sou fèy chapèl, epi elèv High School yo ekri nan yon jounal Here I Stand.`,of:`2b4cb461`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:chapel.entries[1].text`]},{t:`Pami oratè otòn 2026 yo te gen Student Discipleship Pastors (pastè fòmasyon disip pou elèv) legliz la. Elèv klas 6–12 yo mete Honor Dress (rad seremoni) pou ale nan chapèl.`,of:`2037a310`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:chapel.entries[1].muted`]},{t:`Yon chapèl Thanksgiving (Jou Aksyon de Gras) ak yon chapèl Nwèl rasanble tout lekòl la. Se elèv atizay sèn yo ki dirije chapèl Nwèl la.`,of:`7eb173c0`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:chapel.entries[2].text`]},{t:`Elèv dènye ane yo gen tou yon Senior Recognition Chapel (chapèl pou onore elèv dènye ane yo) nan mwa avril.`,of:`77e07003`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:chapel.entries[2].muted`]},{t:`Devosyon High School`,of:`0261e804`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:chapel.entries[3].title`]},{t:`Chak mèkredi, elèv High School yo tande yon devosyon sou youn nan “trannkat temwen ki te kanpe fèm pou Kris la pandan ven syèk”. Yon pwofesè oswa yon pastè rakonte chak istwa.`,of:`0d1d343a`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:chapel.entries[3].text`]},{t:`Devosyon Middle School`,of:`342f0c8f`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:chapel.entries[4].title`]},{t:`Pwofesè yo dirije yon devosyon chak maten. Anvan lekòl, Quiet Time Cafe la ouvè pou devosyon ak pou ekri nan jounal, soti 7:00 rive 7:15 a.m.`,of:`c1ee8239`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:chapel.entries[4].text`]},{t:`Chapel Band`,of:`bbdc6ef1`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:chapel.entries[5].title`]},{t:`Elèv High School yo “pase odisyon, fè repetisyon epi ede pastè adorasyon nou yo dirije chapèl kote se elèv yo ki alatèt”.`,of:`581f599a`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:chapel.entries[5].text`]},{t:`Praise Team`,of:`cf0bf302`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:chapel.entries[6].title`]},{t:`Yon kou Middle School “ki fèt pou elèv ki vle sèvi ak talan mizikal yo pou dirije lòt moun nan adorasyon”.`,of:`6c6a0331`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:chapel.entries[6].text`]},{t:`Fanmi yo ka gade oswa vin vizite.`,of:`6bd62980`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:chapel.note.strong`]},{t:`“Chak chapèl pase an dirèk sou entènèt epi yo sove l nan achiv nou.” Vizitè ki gen 18 an oswa plis ka enskri davans.`,of:`ed0a2feb`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:chapel.note.text`]},{t:`Dat ak lè chapèl yo suiv kalandriye 2026–27 lekòl la ak fòm enskripsyon chapèl li a.`,of:`4d3d5f47`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:chapel.note.muted`]},{t:`Bib se yon kou prensipal obligatwa chak ane. Men sa chak klas etidye, ak kat kredi Bib yon elèv High School bezwen pou gradye.`,of:`7dc817f2`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:classes.headline`]},{t:`“Kou Bib yo obligatwa nan Elementary School, Middle School ak High School”.`,of:`03c8622c`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:classes.intro.text`]},{t:`Elèv Elementary School yo “aprann anviwon yon vèsè Bib pa kè chak semèn”.`,of:`7d00f8bb`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:classes.intro.muted`]},{t:`Elementary School`,of:`444c2b2d`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:classes.groups[0].name`]},{t:`Bib chak jou`,of:`9d765c6c`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:classes.groups[0].tally`]},{t:`Kindergarten–Klas 5`,of:`edc71672`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:classes.groups[0].rows[0].label`]},{t:`Building on the Rock, “yon pwogram sou vizyon biblik sou lemonn ak yon apèsi sou Bib la”. “Chak jou kòmanse ak Ekriti yo, yon devosyon pwofesè a fè ak lapriyè”.`,of:`0008928c`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:classes.groups[0].rows[0].detail`]},{t:`Kingdom Builders`,of:`9a94434e`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:classes.groups[0].rows[1].label`]},{t:`Yon kou espesyal ak “leson ki baze sou Bib la sou bagay tankou kominikasyon, rezoud konfli, rezoud pwoblèm ak bon lespri nan espò”.`,of:`34246ae1`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:classes.groups[0].rows[1].detail`]},{t:`yon kou Bib chak ane`,of:`3ba77ed2`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:classes.groups[1].tally`]},{t:`Building on the Rock`,of:`82cdd00e`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:classes.groups[1].rows[0].label`]},{t:`Vizyon kretyen sou lemonn, ki soti nan Summit Ministries.`,of:`61361a88`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:classes.groups[1].rows[0].detail`]},{t:`Walking in Truth`,of:`2e76621e`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:classes.groups[1].rows[1].label`]},{t:`Li konpare kwayans prensipal Krisyanis la ak Islam, naturalis ak nouvo espiritualite. Li soti nan Summit Ministries.`,of:`c3bd391f`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:classes.groups[1].rows[1].detail`]},{t:`Light Bearers`,of:`77453ec1`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:classes.groups[1].rows[2].label`]},{t:`Li ede elèv yo “konprann kijan yo ka viv vizyon kretyen yo sou lemonn nan yon kilti pòs-kretyen”. Li soti nan Summit Ministries.`,of:`56bce3dc`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:classes.groups[1].rows[2].detail`]},{t:`Kou opsyonèl sou lafwa ak lidèchip`,of:`427a5e5d`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:classes.groups[1].rows[3].label`]},{t:`Pami kou yo gen Becoming a Young Man of God ak Becoming a Young Woman of God (klas 7–8), Student on Mission, ak Christian Leadership pou kèk elèv 8yèm ane yo chwazi.`,of:`120cc5ee`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:classes.groups[1].rows[3].detail`]},{t:`High School`,of:`8ab05d33`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:classes.groups[2].name`]},{t:`4 kredi Bib pou gradye`,of:`f3ba47fd`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:classes.groups[2].tally`]},{t:`Nivo preparasyon inivèsite oswa honors. Elèv yo “fè yon apèsi sou tout Bib la atravè gwo tèm”.`,of:`f8d1174b`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:classes.groups[2].rows[0].detail`]},{t:`Nivo preparasyon inivèsite oswa honors. Liv Nouvo Testaman yo, monn epòk la ak lavi Kris la.`,of:`b2b63ff9`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:classes.groups[2].rows[1].detail`]},{t:`Christian Apologetics`,of:`8e467286`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:classes.groups[2].rows[2].label`]},{t:`Nivo preparasyon inivèsite oswa honors. Elèv yo aprann “prèv lojik, filozofik, istorik ak syantifik pou lafwa kretyen an”. Lòt chwa a se Honors Introduction to Philosophy.`,of:`13dd27c3`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:classes.groups[2].rows[2].detail`]},{t:`Systematic Theology`,of:`2723738e`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:classes.groups[2].rows[3].label`]},{t:`Nivo preparasyon inivèsite oswa honors. Elèv yo “ranfòse konpreyansyon yo sou doktrin ki esansyèl pou lafwa kretyen òtodòks la”. Lòt chwa a se Honors Introduction to Ethics.`,of:`e795a1ff`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:classes.groups[2].rows[3].detail`]},{t:`Introduction to Bible`,of:`167dd6e0`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:classes.groups[2].rows[4].label`]},{t:`Yon kou “rekòmande pou elèv ki pa janm ale nan yon lekòl kretyen oswa ki fèk antre nan HGCS”. Se sou rekòmandasyon lekòl la yon elèv enskri ladan l.`,of:`5fc47c09`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:classes.groups[2].rows[4].detail`]},{t:`Honors ak kredi inivèsite.`,of:`85df5dd5`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:classes.note.strong`]},{t:`Senk kou Bib honors se kou dual enrollment (doub enskripsyon) ak Judson College, “pwogram inivèsite premye sik Southeastern Baptist Theological Seminary (SEBTS)”.`,of:`aa231f5b`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:classes.note.text`]},{t:`Elèv Spanish Immersion (imèsyon an panyòl) nan Middle School yo pran Bib an panyòl.`,of:`d66b9c75`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:classes.note.muted`]},{t:`Kote elèv yo pale sou lafwa nan pi piti gwoup: gwoup chak mwa nan Middle School ak gwoup pwofesè dirije nan High School.`,of:`ea4ea9d7`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:groups.headline`]},{t:`Grove Groups`,of:`d6c20d68`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:groups.entries[0].title`]},{t:`“Chak premye jedi nan mwa a”, elèv yo reyini pa nivo klas pou aprann nan “lavi mati, misyonè ak mantò yo”, apre sa yo separe an ti gwoup fòmasyon disip.`,of:`8194ca24`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:groups.entries[0].text`]},{t:`Gwoup fòmasyon disip (D-groups)`,of:`5887b986`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:groups.entries[1].title`]},{t:`“Yo mete chak elèv High School nan yon ti gwoup fòmasyon disip yon pwofesè dirije.” Gwoup yo reyini pandan lè Club Flex nan mitan jounen an, pifò jedi.`,of:`98ff950b`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:groups.entries[1].text`]},{t:`Yon pastè pou elèv sou kanpis la`,of:`e2c19d02`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:groups.entries[2].title`]},{t:`“Pastè fòmasyon disip pou elèv” legliz la “sou kanpis la epi li disponib pou konvèsasyon youn-a-youn ak elèv yo”.`,of:`ec0c5403`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:groups.entries[2].text`]},{t:`Christian Leadership`,of:`7dddde73`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:groups.entries[3].title`]},{t:`Yon kou pou kèk elèv 8yèm ane yo chwazi, ki “ap gen pou yo angaje yo pou sèvi kòm lidè sou kanpis la pandan tout ane lekòl la”.`,of:`439d6477`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:groups.entries[3].text`]},{t:`Ekip espò yo tou.`,of:`4f01fc7b`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:groups.note.strong`]},{t:`Youn nan objektif pwogram espò a se “Fè atlèt yo vin disip”: “N ap fè efò pou gen bon fòmasyon disip nan ekip nou yo.”`,of:`ef4fa25a`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:groups.note.text`]},{t:`Misyon ak vizyon lekòl la, kwayans li bay sou lis, ak rezilta li espere wè nan chak elèv, nan pwòp mo lekòl la.`,of:`e021d1dc`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:beliefs.headline`]},{t:`“Hickory Grove Christian School fòme elèv yo kòm disip atravè yon vizyon biblik sou lemonn; li fòme yo nan etid akademik, espò ak atizay pou yo angaje ak Bondye, konekte ak misyon an, epi saj nan Kris la, pou yo ka konnen L epi fè lòt moun konnen L.”`,of:`5f8ff62b`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:beliefs.mission`]},{t:`Tout verite se verite Bondye, epi yo dwe anseye chak matyè atravè yon vizyon biblik sou lemonn.`,of:`36d2ef5b`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:beliefs.tenets[0]`]},{t:`Edikasyon kretyen se yon efò ansanm ant lekòl la, lakay, Hickory Grove Baptist Church ak tout kò Kris la an jeneral.`,of:`f6f84166`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:beliefs.tenets[1]`]},{t:`Edikasyon kretyen dwe gen yon pèspektiv etènèl, ki konsantre sou delivrans ak fòmasyon disip pwochen jenerasyon an.`,of:`8c70a21c`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:beliefs.tenets[2]`]},{t:`Nan HGCS, yo pa mezire siksè sèlman pa lidèchip, ekselans ak entegrite elèv yo, men sitou pa yon angajman pou tout lavi ak Jezikri.`,of:`0daba68d`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:beliefs.tenets[3]`]},{t:`Yon anviwònman egzijan nan etid akademik, espò ak atizay prepare elèv yo nèt pou defi ki devan yo.`,of:`65c91b53`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:beliefs.tenets[4]`]},{t:`Elèv yo aprann nan diferan fason, kidonk pwofesè nou yo itilize plizyè estrateji ansèyman pou sipòte chak elèv.`,of:`afda4e27`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:beliefs.tenets[5]`]},{t:`Chak elèv kreye dapre imaj Bondye, ak pwòp bezwen espirityèl, akademik, fizik, mantal ak emosyonèl pa li.`,of:`3e390e3c`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:beliefs.tenets[6]`]},{t:`Angaje ak Bondye`,of:`38f9009c`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:beliefs.outcomes[0].name`]},{t:`Konsakre bay Senyè a, ak afeksyon ki byen an lòd`,of:`6a42cc80`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:beliefs.outcomes[0].text`]},{t:`Konekte ak Misyon an`,of:`86faef7c`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:beliefs.outcomes[1].name`]},{t:`Mare ak kò Kris la nan yon misyon ansanm`,of:`5d2fac4e`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:beliefs.outcomes[1].text`]},{t:`Saj nan Kris la`,of:`5686ade5`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:beliefs.outcomes[2].name`]},{t:`Konn fè diferans ant sajès biblik Bondye ak sajès lemonn`,of:`0148d0ab`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:beliefs.outcomes[2].text`]},{t:`Yon ministè Hickory Grove Baptist Church.`,of:`675ad5ae`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:beliefs.note.strong`]},{t:`Vizyon li: “Konnen Kris la epi fè lòt moun konnen L atravè edikasyon kretyen.”`,of:`20f3e7c2`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:beliefs.note.text`]},{t:`Vèsè lekòl la se Matthew 6:33. Lekòl la gen doub akreditasyon atravè Cognia ak Association of Christian Schools International (ACSI).`,of:`1145ea45`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:beliefs.note.muted`]},{t:`Lis verifikasyon chak klas mande yon “Personal Recommendation form” (fòm rekòmandasyon pèsonèl) pastè fanmi an ranpli. Pou Middle School ak High School, li “soti nan pastè elèv la/fanmi an”.`,of:`3492170f`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:families.groups[0].rows[0].detail`]},{t:`“Entèvyou ak Fanmi an se yon okazyon pou pataje Misyon an, Vizyon an ak Deklarasyon Lafwa a, epi pou evalye si HGCS bon pou fanmi w”.`,of:`7e1fcf3b`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:families.groups[0].rows[1].detail`]},{t:`Kesyonè elèv la`,of:`70bc4595`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:families.groups[0].rows[2].label`]},{t:`Kandida pou klas 4–12 ranpli yon Student Questionnaire (kesyonè elèv). Kesyon li yo pa sou sit piblik la.`,of:`58072980`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:families.groups[0].rows[2].detail`]},{t:`Manm legliz la aplike an premye`,of:`62834a83`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:families.groups[0].rows[3].label`]},{t:`Aplikasyon yo te ouvri 2 novanm 2026 pou manm legliz la, elèv Early Education Center ak frè ak sè yo, epi 16 novanm pou tout nouvo fanmi.`,of:`ff1eefee`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:families.groups[0].rows[3].detail`]},{t:`Paj piblik yo pa di si yon paran dwe kretyen oswa manm yon legliz. Fòm enterè preschool Mallard Creek la poze kesyon sou legliz fanmi an ak lafwa paran yo.`,of:`90bc5e19`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:families.groups[0].rows[4].detail`]},{t:`Dakò ak yon deklarasyon lafwa`,of:`4d0e62a1`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:families.groups[0].rows[5].label`]},{t:`Paj piblik yo pa di si fanmi yo siyen youn.`,of:`78c021b6`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:families.groups[0].rows[5].detail`]},{t:`Obligatwa chak ane.`,of:`b2052a02`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:families.groups[1].rows[0].detail`]},{t:`Honor Code`,of:`44cd5ffc`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:families.groups[1].rows[1].label`]},{t:`“Chak elèv High School siyen Student Honor Code nou an, yon alyans ki òganize sou twa Rezilta Nou Atann pou Elèv yo.”`,of:`32678a3d`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:families.groups[1].rows[1].detail`]},{t:`Rad pou chapèl`,of:`2f4b2596`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:families.groups[1].rows[2].label`]},{t:`“Honor Dress obligatwa pou tout pwogram chapèl nan klas 6yèm rive 12yèm ane ak nan kèk aktivite espesyal.”`,of:`94b46255`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:families.groups[1].rows[2].detail`]},{t:`Anons travay la mande yon “Kretyen angaje ki dakò ak Deklarasyon Lafwa lekòl la” ki “aktif nan yon legliz lokal ki kwè nan Bib la”.`,of:`13cc08e6`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:families.note.text`]},{t:`Lekòl la kenbe Parent-Student Handbook (manyèl paran ak elèv) li a ak aplikasyon sou entènèt li a dèyè yon koneksyon pou fanmi.`,of:`80ae7348`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:families.note.muted`]},{t:`Elèv dènye ane yo fè yon vwayaj misyonè nan Repiblik Dominikèn chak ane, epi tout lekòl la bay pou yon kòz chak trimès.`,of:`c319faa6`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:service.headline`]},{t:`Vwayaj misyonè elèv dènye ane yo`,of:`33553cb2`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:service.entries[0].title`]},{t:`“Elèv dènye ane nou yo sèvi ansanm chak ane nan yon vwayaj misyonè nan Repiblik Dominikèn.” Vwayaj 2026–27 la fèt nan mwa janvye 2027.`,of:`e89f1c2f`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:service.entries[0].text`]},{t:`Semèn Misyon High School`,of:`2ac49c4f`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:service.entries[1].title`]},{t:`“Pandan elèv dènye ane yo pa la, rès High School la sèvi kominote lokal la atravè Mission Week (Semèn Misyon).”`,of:`e298e406`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:service.entries[1].text`]},{t:`Kolèk pou misyon chak trimès`,of:`d7df1e39`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:service.entries[2].title`]},{t:`“Chak trimès, fanmi lekòl nou an bay pou sipòte yon ministè oswa yon kòz lokal.” Pami kòz yo nonmen gen XChange, yon ministè legliz la pou moun ki gen depandans; Operation Christmas Child; ak yon Baby Bottle Drive (kolèk nan bibon) “pou sipòte sakre lavi moun”.`,of:`421bf44c`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:service.entries[2].text`]},{t:`HGBC Food Pantry`,of:`2e9ac33b`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:service.entries[3].title`]},{t:`Elèv Spanish Immersion yo “sèvi kòm entèprèt chak semèn pandan pastè nou yo ap pataje Levanjil la ak kominote nou an”. Laboratwa akwaponik High School la “kiltive manje pou HG Food Pantry”.`,of:`5db014a7`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:service.entries[3].text`]},{t:`Student on Mission`,of:`23157b7b`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:service.entries[4].title`]},{t:`Yon kou Middle School ki “etidye sa Bondye ap fè toupatou sou latè ak kijan elèv yo ka sèvi Charlotte”.`,of:`84aa6016`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:service.entries[4].text`]},{t:`Global Missions & Language Certificate`,of:`80313ab8`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:service.entries[5].title`]},{t:`Elèv yo jwenn li ak twa inite nan yon lang etranjè, kou Bib honors, “omwen yon vwayaj misyonè entènasyonal” ak yon staj pratik oswa yon entènship nan misyon.`,of:`b39f9bee`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:service.entries[5].text`]},{t:`Katalòg kou yo ajoute yon lòt egzijans: “Se pou w yon manm aktif nan yon legliz ki gen menm lafwa, sa ki verifye pa yon lèt rekòmandasyon pozitif yon pastè ekri, depreferans Pastè Jèn elèv la.”`,of:`ec79c40a`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:service.entries[5].muted`]},{t:`Fanmi akèy`,of:`08de32bd`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:service.entries[6].title`]},{t:`Fanmi legliz la ak fanmi lekòl la ka resevwa yon elèv entènasyonal lakay yo. Lekòl la rele sa “misyon nan sans envès”.`,of:`ff765539`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:service.entries[6].text`]},{t:`Misyon pi lwen pase Charlotte.`,of:`ccf8f5b9`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:service.note.strong`]},{t:`Lekòl la nonmen “efò misyon entènasyonal nan Repiblik Dominikèn, Ekwatè, Ayiti ak Kenya”.`,of:`69d038ac`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:service.note.text`]},{t:`Paj lekòl la pa bay okenn egzijans èdtan sèvis.`,of:`5de87f7f`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:service.note.muted`]},{t:`Pastè Hickory Grove Baptist Church anseye nan chapèl epi yo dirije sesyon pou paran yo. Lekòl la pa mansyone okenn chaplen pa li.`,of:`91c82d15`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:staff.headline`]},{t:`Pastè Prensipal, Hickory Grove Baptist Church; manm Konsèy Konsiltatif`,of:`62f34cd6`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:staff.people[0].role`]},{t:`Pastè Fòmasyon Disip pou Elèv, Hickory Grove Baptist Church`,of:`29d78e88`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:staff.people[1].role`,`hickory-grove-christian:staff.people[2].role`]},{t:`Pastè Fòmasyon Disip pou Fanmi, Hickory Grove Baptist Church`,of:`f6d67519`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:staff.people[3].role`,`hickory-grove-christian:staff.people[4].role`]},{t:`Chèf Depatman Bib, High School`,of:`a7f858b3`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:staff.people[5].role`]},{t:`Bib Middle School, Edikasyon Fizik (PE)`,of:`21497841`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:staff.people[6].role`]},{t:`Pwofesè ak dirijan yo fè devosyon mèkredi yo chak a tou pa yo.`,of:`c96e81fc`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:staff.note.strong`]},{t:`Pami oratè otòn 2026 yo te gen direktè jeneral lekòl la ak direktè High School la.`,of:`78ceaec7`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:staff.note.muted`]},{t:`Yon sesyon pou paran nan maten chapèl yo, rezime pou lakay sou chak chapèl ak chak devosyon, ak yon gwoup lapriyè chak mwa.`,of:`f368223d`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:parents.headline`]},{t:`Lions Connect`,of:`d035b4a2`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:parents.entries[0].title`]},{t:`“Lions Connect reyini nan maten chapèl yo, ant Chapèl Elementary School ak Chapèl Middle School ak High School, pou w ka adore ak pitit ou epi rete pou toude.” Se pastè legliz la ki dirije l, a 9:00 AM.`,of:`237fa7e7`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:parents.entries[0].text`]},{t:`Sijè otòn 2026 yo se te “Because I Told You So” (Paske se mwen ki di w sa) ak “Hard Providences” (Pwovidans ki difisil).`,of:`30748e72`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:parents.entries[0].muted`]},{t:`Chapel at Home`,of:`303afda6`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:parents.entries[1].title`]},{t:`Apre chak chapèl, fanmi yo resevwa yon rezime ak mesaj la, pasaj Ekriti li a ak “kèk kesyon pou diskite ak pitit ou”. Gen yon vèsyon pou Elementary School ak yon vèsyon pou Middle School ak High School.`,of:`119beb08`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:parents.entries[1].text`]},{t:`Rezime devosyon yo`,of:`d198ee5d`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:parents.entries[2].title`]},{t:`Yon rezime yon paj sou chak devosyon mèkredi High School la, “pou w ka poze pitit ou kesyon sou li pandan manje aswè oswa nan machin nan”.`,of:`8b520ec0`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:parents.entries[2].text`]},{t:`Lions in Prayer`,of:`0b8e5ea6`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:parents.entries[3].title`]},{t:`“Paran yo reyini yon fwa pa mwa pou priye pou elèv nou yo, anplwaye nou yo ak lekòl nou an.” Reyinyon yo fèt a 8:00 AM premye lendi nan mwa a.`,of:`beaefa22`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:parents.entries[3].text`]},{t:`Parent Teacher Fellowship (asosyasyon paran ak pwofesè) la.`,of:`b1101883`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:parents.note.strong`]},{t:`“Nou rele tèt nou yon fellowship (kominyon) paske nou se kwayan ki ini pou fè Edikasyon Wayòm nan avanse.”`,of:`09ed8c22`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:parents.note.text`]},{t:`Kontak: Cynthia Sampson, cynthiasampson@hgchristian.org.`,of:`2bfea94f`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:parents.note.muted`]},{t:`Douz kesyon pou w pote nan vizit la. Chak kesyon se sou yon bagay paj piblik lekòl la pa reponn oswa di de fason diferan.`,of:`44bce139`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:ask.headline`]},{t:`Kisa fòm rekòmandasyon pastè a mande? E si fanmi nou pa gen yon pastè?`,of:`b242ce9b`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:ask.questions[1]`]},{t:`Èske nou ka li Deklarasyon Lafwa yo pataje nan entèvyou ak fanmi an? Èske fanmi yo siyen l?`,of:`e9e95fd8`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:ask.questions[2]`]},{t:`Konbyen fwa chapèl reyini? Yon paj di yon fwa pa mwa, epi kalandriye 2026–27 la gen de nan mwa mas.`,of:`bce6454c`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:ask.questions[4]`]},{t:`Konbyen fwa gwoup fòmasyon disip High School yo reyini? Yon paj di plizyè fwa pa mwa, yon lòt di pifò jedi.`,of:`b8ed44ef`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:ask.questions[5]`]},{t:`Èske tout elèv dènye ane yo ale nan vwayaj misyonè Repiblik Dominikèn nan, epi èske li fè pati frè eskolè a?`,of:`895c399b`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:ask.questions[6]`]},{t:`Konbyen kredi Bib yon elèv ki antre nan 10yèm, 11yèm oswa 12yèm ane bezwen?`,of:`a7b381c8`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:ask.questions[7]`]},{t:`Èske gen retrèt, pou nenpòt klas?`,of:`6423bdb4`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:ask.questions[8]`]},{t:`Èske èdtan sèvis obligatwa?`,of:`65648d57`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:ask.questions[9]`]},{t:`Èske elèv Elementary School ak Middle School siyen Honor Code la tou?`,of:`e43e6b9e`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:ask.questions[10]`]},{t:`Èske nou ka li Parent-Student Handbook la anvan nou enskri?`,of:`65b596cb`,at:[`hickory-grove-christian:ask.questions[11]`]}]};export{e as default};